{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-b04d4e534635c2fce0bbf9811172d9d921cabf4aab1460df","family_id":"KR:012159","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Special Act on Investigating the Truth of the April 16 Sewol Ferry Disaster and Building a Safe Society","title_original":"4ㆍ16세월호참사 진상규명 및 안전사회 건설 등을 위한 특별법","kind":"법률","source_version":"284117","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=284117","source_sha256":"c141291f23520264444e31f7c7002ae169ff7b5f49b50f81aade863d8c364da6","body_sha256":"65528f86d825e0ae2b80f0d7efad6be09d91d8dbcaaad2a2202290031890babf","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 51 (Penalty Provisions) (1) Any person who, in violation of Article 43 (1), assaults or intimidates a Commissioner or employee of the Inquest, a member of an advisory organ, or an appraiser, or obstructs the performance of his/her duties by fraudulent means, shall be punished by imprisonment with labor for not exceeding five years or by a fine not exceeding 50 million won.\n  (2) Any of the following persons shall be punished by imprisonment with labor for not exceeding three years or by a fine not exceeding 30 million won: \n  1. Any person who damages the reputation of any third person or the deceased, by disclosing the identity of a person subject to investigation or a reference witness, or matters examined with respect thereto, in violation of Article 44 (1); \n  2. Any person who fails to submit materials or things to a hearing without just grounds; \n  3. Any witness who fails to attend a hearing, take an oath, or give testimony without just grounds;  \n  4. Any appraiser who fails to take an oath or conduct appraisal at a hearing without just grounds;\n  5. Any witness or appraiser who gives false testimony or appraisal at a hearing;\n  6. Any person who interferes with the attendance of a witness, appraiser, or reference witness at a hearing, or with a verification. \n  (3) Any of the following persons shall be punished by imprisonment with labor for not exceeding two years or by a fine not exceeding 20 million won:   \n  1. Any person who divulges professional confidential information of the Inquest or uses any such information for any purpose, other than performing duties of the Inquest, in violation of Article 41; \n  2. Any person who exercises the authority of the Inquest by falsely pretending to be a Commissioner or employee of the Inquest or a member of an advisory organ, by falsely pretending to have been delegated or entrusted with duties of the Inquest, or by falsely pretending to jointly perform duties of the Inquest, in violation of Article 42.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.title.json","sha256":"4c74ab84248a6134281cf6996ae8261b572ae5b9e5754e6ad1e8c39880d0d84f"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-51.json","sha256":"07202ac08ecfacad82f9654702302ccdca7e63b403c92dd6cc80f22b1480562c"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\article-51.selfcheck.json","sha256":"917f548bbab6b7a376f395ead1fdfaf778b5c52d417df8f17456d0db11d38f43"},"text":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1525_KR012159\\translations\\act\\en.units.parts\\artic